## Issue
User `jane.smith` was unable to log in due to a forgotten password.

---

## Investigation
- Confirmed user account exists
- Determined issue was related to authentication (forgotten password)

---

## Resolution
1. Opened Command Prompt as Administrator  
2. Reset password using: net user jane.smith TempPass123!
3. Attempted to enforce password change at next login
   - Not applied due to limitations in local VM environment

---

##  Result
User successfully logged in and was prompted to create a new password.

